  "id": "31309450",
  "title": "习近平在兰州考察黄河治理项目和读者出版集团",
  "date": "2019-08-21 20:19:03",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：王静                        )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n习近平总书记21日下午来到甘肃省兰州市，前往黄河治理兰铁泵站项目点，了解黄河治理和保护、堤坝加固防洪工程建设等情况。随后，他前往读者出版集团有限公司考察调研。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰、王晔）</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212022000388323804456.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212022000519144968701.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212023000040672599967.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212023000387339809249.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212023000204349662400.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212024000088672239103.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212024000178288925791.jpg\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em; text-align: center;\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2019/0821/MAIN201908212024000287861094971.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "习近平总书记21日下午来到甘肃省兰州市，前往黄河治理兰铁泵站项目点，了解黄河治理和保护、堤坝加固防洪工程建设等情况。随后，他前往读者出版集团有限公司考察调研。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰、王晔）"
  ]
}
